OL,3,ACo-ordinated cattle raids kill at least
OL,4,A72 people in South Sudan
OL,5,
OL,6,FClashes over territory are also common
OL,7,Facross the country as it prepares to
OL,8,Fhold its first election since its
OL,9,Findependence in 2011 - delayed because
OL,10,Fof a brutal civil war.
